participants: Client 1, Lock service, Client 2, Storage
Client 1 -> Lock service: acquire lock
Lock service --> Client 1: granted, token 33
note over Client 1: long pause (GC); lease expires
Client 2 -> Lock service: acquire lock
Lock service --> Client 2: granted, token 34
Client 2 -> Storage: write (token 34)
Storage --> Client 2: accepted (highest token = 34)
Client 1 -> Storage: write (token 33)
Storage --> Client 1: REJECTED (33 is less than 34)
